{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14525","headline":"游清溪兰若 · 戴叔伦","name":"游清溪兰若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西看叠嶂几千重，秀色孤标此一峰。\n丹竈久闲荒宿草，碧溪深处有潜龙。\n灵仙已去空岩室，到客唯闻古寺钟。\n远对白云幽隐在，年年不离旧杉松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}